# Starlit Soothsayer: losing life counts as much as gaining it. Bot1's own Lightning Bolt takes 3 life on turn 1; at the end step it
# surveils 1 and leaves the Swamp on top of its library (no card goes to the graveyard but the Bolt).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Starlit Soothsayer
Lightning Bolt
Plains
Plains
Plains
Swamp
Island
Plains x10

